{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04968","headline":"古意 · 吴少微","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳芳树向春开，洛阳女儿平旦来。\n流车走马纷相催，折芳瑶华向曲台。\n曲台自有千万行，重花累叶间垂杨。\n北林朝日境明光，南国微风苏合香。\n可怜窈窕女，不作邯郸娼。\n妙舞轻回拂长袖，高歌浩唱发清商。\n歌终舞罢欢无极，乐往悲来长叹息。\n阳春白日不少留，红荣碧树无颜色。\n碧树风花先春度，珠帘粉泽无人顾。\n如何年少忽迟暮，坐见明月与白露。\n明月白露夜已寒，香衣锦带空珊珊。\n今日阳春一妙曲，凤皇楼上与君弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴少微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}